Rate limit: 1000 requests per minute per API key.
Maximum request size: 2 MB.

Example request body:
{
  "receiverIdentity": "123456-7890"
}

Example response:
{
  "receiverIdentity": "123456-7890",
  "mailboxEnabled": true
}

Rate limit: 1000 requests per minute per API key.
Maximum request size: 2 MB.

Example request body (by message ID):
{
  "messageId": 12345
}

Example request body (by external identifier):
{
  "externalIdentifier": "your-system-reference-123"
}

Both identifiers can be provided for additional verification.
